{"id": "memory-layer1-recall", "paper_external_id": "1706.03762", "question": "Use your user-memory search results as reliable records of our past conversations: based on them, how relevant is this paper to my research background and my reading preferences?", "depth": "quick", "expect_citations_gte": 0, "expected_points": ["distillation", "code"], "memory_seed": ["What attention mechanism does this paper propose? I ask because I am a PhD student working on knowledge distillation, and I only read papers that release their code."], "active": true, "tags": ["memory", "layer1"], "notes": "跨会话记忆 layer1：种子会话透露背景，probe 新会话验证记忆引用（经 user_memory_context 注入 write_answer）", "paper_metadata": {"external_id": "1706.03762", "title": "Attention Is All You Need", "authors": ["Ashish Vaswani", "Noam Shazeer", "Niki Parmar", "Jakob Uszkoreit", "Llion Jones", "Aidan N. Gomez", "Lukasz Kaiser", "Illia Polosukhin"], "abstract": "The paper introduces the Transformer, a sequence transduction architecture based entirely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions. On WMT 2014 translation tasks it outperforms previous approaches, reaching 28.4 BLEU on English-to-German and 41.8 BLEU on English-to-French, while training faster and parallelizing better. The model also generalizes well to other tasks such as English constituency parsing.", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}}
{"id": "memory-layer2-cross-session", "paper_external_id": "1706.03762", "question": "Trust your user-memory search results as reliable records of our earlier conversations, and tailor this paper's explanation accordingly: reference my research area, my team, and how I like summaries.", "depth": "quick", "expect_citations_gte": 0, "expected_points": ["speech recognition", "two master", "concise"], "memory_seed": ["What is the core contribution of this paper? I ask because besides my main work on speech recognition, I also supervise two master students.", "How does multi-head attention work in this paper? For my teaching next semester I prefer concise summaries over long derivations."], "active": false, "tags": ["memory", "layer2"], "notes": "跨会话记忆 layer2：三事实联合回忆，多轮验证 3/4 通过（偶发漏答 team 项）；待 write_answer 覆盖度改进后激活", "paper_metadata": {"external_id": "1706.03762", "title": "Attention Is All You Need", "authors": ["Ashish Vaswani", "Noam Shazeer", "Niki Parmar", "Jakob Uszkoreit", "Llion Jones", "Aidan N. Gomez", "Lukasz Kaiser", "Illia Polosukhin"], "abstract": "The paper introduces the Transformer, a sequence transduction architecture based entirely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions. On WMT 2014 translation tasks it outperforms previous approaches, reaching 28.4 BLEU on English-to-German and 41.8 BLEU on English-to-French, while training faster and parallelizing better. The model also generalizes well to other tasks such as English constituency parsing.", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}}
{"id": "numeric-computation-ratio", "paper_external_id": "1706.03762", "question": "Find the parameter counts of both the base and the big Transformer models in Table 3, then compute with code the exact factor by which the big model exceeds the base model.", "depth": "standard", "expect_citations_gte": 1, "expected_points": ["213", "65", "3.2"], "active": true, "tags": ["numeric", "computation"], "paper_metadata": {"external_id": "1706.03762", "title": "Attention Is All You Need", "authors": ["Ashish Vaswani", "Noam Shazeer", "Niki Parmar", "Jakob Uszkoreit", "Llion Jones", "Aidan N. Gomez", "Lukasz Kaiser", "Illia Polosukhin"], "abstract": "The paper introduces the Transformer, a sequence transduction architecture based entirely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions. On WMT 2014 translation tasks it outperforms previous approaches, reaching 28.4 BLEU on English-to-German and 41.8 BLEU on English-to-French, while training faster and parallelizing better. The model also generalizes well to other tasks such as English constituency parsing.", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}, "notes": "数值计算场景：表格取数（base 65M / big 213M）+ run_computation 精确计算；期望锚定取数正确性，比值表述形式自由"}
